				Time="2011-11-24T03:08:52" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]姫『何ですってー！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
